## Hotfix propagation

A production fix must exist on every active line that can ship the bug again:

| Line | Required | Why |
|---|---|---|
{{propagation_rows}}

Never merge all of `{{production_branch}}` into a release to obtain one fix when it carries unrelated changes; use a PR from the hotfix branch or a controlled backport.

## Cherry-pick

Not a promotion mechanism between environments. Allowed only as a deliberate backport; write the reason in the PR.

## Rewriting history

No force-push on `{{protected_branches}}`; rebase only personal branches nobody else has pulled.

